<div class="card">
    <h2>Step 3: Psychological Safety</h2>
    <p class="form-hint">Whether people can speak up, raise concerns and admit mistakes without fear of being punished or humiliated.</p>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="psych_safety_ps1">1. I can raise difficult issues at work without fear of negative consequences.</label>
        <select id="psych_safety_ps1" name="psych_safety.ps1">
            <option value="" {% if psych_safety.ps1 == "" or psych_safety.ps1 == null %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
            <option value="1" {% if psych_safety.ps1 == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 &mdash; Strongly disagree</option>
            <option value="2" {% if psych_safety.ps1 == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; Disagree</option>
            <option value="3" {% if psych_safety.ps1 == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 &mdash; Neutral</option>
            <option value="4" {% if psych_safety.ps1 == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; Agree</option>
            <option value="5" {% if psych_safety.ps1 == 5 %}selected{% endif %}>5 &mdash; Strongly agree</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="psych_safety_ps2">2. I can admit a mistake here without being humiliated or punished.</label>
